### Get all tickets

GET http://localhost:8080/tickets
Authorization: Basic user helpdesk123
Accept: application/json


### Create a ticket

POST http://localhost:8080/tickets
Authorization: Basic user helpdesk123
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Cannot access my account",
  "description": "I am unable to log in with my usual password.",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "customerId": 1
}